    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>The project is a residential compound located at Masharef Hills district, nearby King Salman Road, in northern Riyadh, on a total area of 13,300 sqms. The compound comprises 50 villas and high-end facilities, i.e. gardens, play areas, hypermarkets and mosques.</p>\r\n",
